  "description": "Who am I? Play the animal guessing game with Milo the bluebird! Listen to three clues, guess the animal, then see why each fact is true: zebra stripes keep flies away, pigs roll in mud to keep cool, a koala is not a bear, and polar bears paddle with paws as big as dinner plates.\nAn interactive animal guessing game for kids ages 2-6, with questions to answer, actions to copy and a quiz at the end.\n\nThe Animated Zoo makes gentle, colorful videos for little learners. New videos every day! Made with care for ages 2-6. Characters and visuals are animated with the help of AI tools and reviewed for kid safety before publishing.",
